-- words --
At a select this clone's Results show, hyp status lists the owner's place: the Goal has one candidate C1 and shows selected; hyp status GOAL --role owner lists a hyp place line beside land, unselect and close.
-- run --
HYP_ACTOR=owner hyp status GOAL --role owner
-- floor: contains --
  hyp place GOAL
-- floor: contains --
  hyp land GOAL
